+# The status line under an empty or drafted prompt. Forms and permission
+# dialogs replace it with their own key hints, and a running turn shows
+# "esc to interrupt", so a draft that happens to read like a prompt
+# ("do you want to proceed? … esc to cancel") can't pass for one.
